# verbs-quest — deployment & repo notes

## Git identity (local repo only)

- `user.name`: Jorge Martí
- `user.email`: jormarma@gmail.com

## Vite / asset paths

- Production `base` must be `/` for Cloudflare Pages at `https://verbs-quest.pages.dev/`.
- Old broken builds used `base: '/verbs-quest/'` and title `temp-app`; assets 404 and return `index.html` as `text/html` → MIME errors in console.
- Build output: `dist/` (gitignored). `docs/` is committed for GitHub Pages.

## Hosting (two separate targets)

| Target | URL | Status |
|--------|-----|--------|
| Cloudflare Pages | `verbs-quest.pages.dev` | Needs explicit Wrangler deploy or CF dashboard build config |
| GitHub Pages | `jormarma.github.io/verbs-quest/` | Auto-deploys from `/docs` on `main` via `pages build and deployment` |

Cloudflare is **not** auto-deploying from git pushes (no Cloudflare checks on commits). GitHub Pages **is** connected.

## Deploy to Cloudflare Pages

```bash
npx wrangler login
pnpm deploy:cloudflare
```

Or set GitHub secrets `CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN` + `CLOUDFLARE_ACCOUNT_ID` and run the manual workflow `.github/workflows/cloudflare-pages.yml`.

Dashboard settings (if using git builds): build `pnpm build:prod`, output `dist`, Node 20.

## Production env

- `.env.production` (committed): `VITE_SPACETIMEDB_URI`, `VITE_SPACETIMEDB_DB`
- SPA routing: `public/_redirects` → `/* /index.html 200`
- `wrangler.toml`: `pages_build_output_dir = "./dist"`
